          "field": "workaround_documented",
          "status": "supported",
          "value": "When using the NRST pin, configure the reset mode to power-on reset: 1. On the first system power-on reset, set the reset type to power-on reset by setting the CORE_RESET_TYPE bit in the SYSCFG_CM55RSTCR register. 2. Generate a software reset by setting the SYSRESETREQ bit in the AIRCR register of the SBC. In the main application code, declare a global variable at any address in AXISRAM1; at the start of main, if the variable is not 0x11223344, set it to 0x11223344, enable SYSCFG clock, set power-on reset from NRST pin in SYSCFG->CM55RSTCR, issue __ISB() and __DSB(), then call NVIC_SystemReset()."
